 * The LHDN MyInvois TIN verdict record.
 *
 * Two jobs. It survives a cache flush, so a verdict is a durable fact about a
 * buyer rather than something that evaporates. And it answers "did we check
 * this, when, and what did LHDN say?" -- which is the question asked months
 * later, when nobody can recall.
 *
 * PRIVACY IS THE CONSTRAINT HERE. A TIN, an NRIC and a passport number are
