             * have hurt: these columns are written once and read as evidence,
             * and an implicit ON UPDATE would quietly turn "first" into "last".
             *
             * sqlite does not do any of this, so the test suite cannot catch
             * it. See tests/Unit/MigrationTimestampTest.php, which reads these
             * files as text for exactly that reason.
